---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms for using the GrowthPeak Digital website, the free audit and the interactive estimate tool."
  updated="October 16, 2026"
>
  <p>
    These terms cover your use of this website. By using it, you agree to them. If you do not agree,
    please do not use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>What this site is</h2>
  <p>
    This site describes the services {site.name} offers to local service businesses. The information on it is
    general and may change. Nothing here is legal, tax or financial advice.
  </p>

  <h2>The free audit</h2>
  <p>
    The Lead Leak Audit is free and comes with no obligation. It is based on what you submit and on
    information that is publicly available, such as your Google listing and website. It is a set of
    recommendations, not a guarantee of any result.
  </p>

  <h2>The estimate tool</h2>
  <p>
    The cost estimator is an interactive model. It does arithmetic on the numbers you enter. It does
    not predict your results, and it does not describe what any past client achieved.
  </p>

  <h2>No guarantee of results</h2>
  <p>
    Results from local SEO, automation and website work depend on your market, your competitors and
    your business. We do not promise specific rankings, leads, revenue or timelines.
  </p>

  <h2>Paid work</h2>
  <p>
    If you hire us, the work is covered by a separate written agreement or order. These terms do not
    replace it.
  </p>

  <h2>Using the site</h2>
  <p>
    Please do not misuse the site, attempt to break or overload it, or submit false or harmful
    information through the form. Our content, including text, graphics and logos, belongs to
    {site.name}. You may not copy or reuse it without our permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to third-party pages such as our social profiles. We do not control those sites
    and are not responsible for them.
  </p>

  <h2>Disclaimers and liability</h2>
  <p>
    The site is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. To the extent the law allows,
    {site.name} is not liable for any loss that comes from using the site or relying on its content.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms. The date at the top of this page shows when they last changed.
    Continuing to use the site after a change means you accept the updated terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms? Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
